@host = http://localhost:5200

### 1. GET / -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST hop le -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET luot nop -> 200 (Bam nhieu lan thay doi: received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "khong-phai-url"
}

### 6. POST bai 99 (khong ton tai) -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET id rong -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. negotiate (Bat tay SignalR) -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. sai hub (Sai duong dan hub) -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1